  <book code="1CO" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:31:40 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Kô-rin-tô đu mưi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kô-rin-tô</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Co</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Kô-rin-tô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Phaau-lô, bâân dhaloong têêng sưưq-đô ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih tââq karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq manưih adhi anó Sôôt-theen, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />pagơơi đóng akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt dhiq Kô-rin-tô, nek nôôq manưih ơi bâân sek liêm kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hơq nek nôôq manưih huuiq bâân dhaloong, nek palơq dyóp manưih tơơt plok dyóp dhiq gavơh dhaloong dhanóók Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek Chuôq ưng piđó lơq ưng nôôq he. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Rââm nhan ơơn phươk liêm lơq rau yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama nôôq he, lơq tââq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Aku taluôn ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng ưng aku leq adhi anó ơi taai ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq, nek rau ơi bâân đóng leq adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ơi kalóóng dyóp rau adhi anó ơi bâân têêng đóng karvaan ve kalóóng Ađó, kalóóng dyóp rau paraaq praaq lơq dyóp rau bhriêl n'nal, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />dhiêp kơi paraaq truuih đuui leq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân lêi alua dhakơi m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Tơk mơ, adhi anó yươq tabhuch hat dhiq dhơ dharau ơơn Chuôq đóng, xók jêi tarang rââm đương rau tapakah ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />nek Yaang kung e têêng adhi anó tamưng đóng tơk tatun xariêq, đóng óóq dhiq trêh teng kalóóng tangêi ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Yaang Pleng nek yươq tadhơ; tââq Ađó hơq adhi anó ơi bâân dhaloong mót kalóóng dhiq tơơt cha palơq Akóón ưng Ađó, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Bơơi nhan móón adhi anó, aku mââl bhơơl adhi anó tââq dhanóók ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, kơi tabhơt adhi anó phaai ve mađó dhariêng praaq, lơq óóq dyơq vaaih nôôq rau tablah n'tua dhiq m'pơng adhi anó; hơq adhi anó phaai bâân panjoop palơq xóng ađêi kalóóng mađó lóóm karnóq lơq kalóóng mađó karnóq tarnêêng. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ơi, nhan móón adhi anó ưng aku, đươi manưih đong ưng Kơ-lô-ê, tarlum leq adhi anó ơi bâân pakah giit đóng aku, kơi ve nôôq tarvei tablah tachia m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Aku ve kanóq nek nô kơi, ađek nek ting chanak manưih kalóóng adhi anó praaq kơi ađô: “Aku mađó leq Phaau-lô,” môôiq “Aku mađó leq A-bô-lô,” môôiq “Aku mađó leq Sê-pha” môôiq “Aku mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân takut tablah alua? Ve kơq Phaau-lô ơi bâân teeng đinh dhiq m'baang chatông klóóih đóng adhi anó? Môôiq adhi anó ơi đơơp bap-teem vơn dhanóók Phaau-lô? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Aku ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng taai aku ơi kah têêng bap-teem đóng ngaai kalóóng adhi anó, lơh tââq Kơ-riit-bu lơq Gaai-uut, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />buôn óóq ngaai manưih ve chóóm praaq kơi adhi anó ơi vơn dhanóók aku đơơp bap-teem. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Aku kung ơi têêng bap-teem đóng đong Sê-pha-na. Lơh ađek, aku kah n'nal ađêi ve alua ơi têêng bap-teem đóng ngaai lââng.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Tââq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi kah kayua aku vôôiq têêng bap-teem, hơq nek truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm, eh rau palơq paraaq praaq tabech galang, hơq đóng m'baang chatông ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih yươq bâân lêi nek kah machak.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ơi taruuih liêm ưng m'baang chatông dhơ nek rau ngôôk ngaak nek palơq nôôq manưih chêt bil, bơơi nek palơq nôôq he, nôôq manưih bâân paq, ađek nek mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Tââq ve paraaq xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Aku e pahư tabil rau tabech galang ưng nôôq manưih tabech galang;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">lơq Aku e têêng pahư rau tabech brương ưng nôôq manưih tabech brương.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Manưih tabech galang tơơt n'dhiq? Manưih ve hok tơơt n'dhiq? Manưih tar-ââi ưng klaang ađôk tơơt n'dhiq? Kah alua Yaang Pleng ơi paxar rau tabech galang ưng manưih hóng katiêk xar ngôôk ngaak ơi alua? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Ơi đơơp lêi kơi, kalóóng rau tabech galang ưng Yaang Pleng, manưih hóng katiêk ơi kah đơơp n'nal Yaang Pleng palơq rau tabech galang achêk, hayơq Yaang Pleng ơi bhuui lóóm tapâng rau truuih pachóóm ngôôk khơl, buôn paq ngaai nôôq huuiq. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Ơi taai, manưih Jo Thaaiq nek mââl tamóh nôôq kanal chrih, hayơq manưih Hi-laap nek chêk-tabâân rau tabech galang. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Hayơq nôôq yi nek truuih pachóóm Chuôq Paq Manưih bâân tateeng đinh dhiq m'baang chatông, dhơ nek m'beq dhơl n'đóih dyung nek palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq, bơơi nek rau ngôôk khơl nek palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk palââng. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Mat lââng, nek palơq piđó, nek nôôq manưih bâân dhaloong tađaang, tabhơt Jo Thaaiq palơq Hi-laap, Chuôq Paq Manưih nek mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng lơq rau tabech galang ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ơi rau ngôôk ngaak ưng Yaang Pleng nek tabech galang lơh akóón manưih, lơq rau đu dhur ưng Yaang Pleng nek karơ lơh akóón manưih.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Nhan móón adhi anó, bơơi alua nek adhi anó phaai chamet rau dhaloong tađaang ưng ađêi, lêi kơi kah bơk manưih tabech galang ting ng'kar m'bech, kah bơk manưih karơ kataai, kung kah bơk manưih gluh tââq kabhôôq karvaan. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Pleng ơi chââih nôôq rau ngôôk ngaak ưng manưih hóng katiêk buôn Ađó ve chóóm têêng đóng nôôq manưih tabech galang kachiit, Yaang Pleng ơi chââih nôôq rau dhur lóóm ưng manưih hóng katiêk buôn Ađó ve chóóm têêng đóng nôôq manưih karơ praan kachiit, <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />lơq Yaang Pleng ơi chââih nôôq rau parneq bhlơng, palơq nôôq dhơơm bâân takađiq kalươm kalóóng manưih hóng katiêk, nôôq rau kah ve, buôn Ađó ve chóóm têêng nôôq rau ve yuur xar kah ve, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />hơq đóng dyóp ng'kar m'bech yươq chóóm rau laach jơơr toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Bơơi đươi Ađó, adhi anó tơơt kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek Yaang bâân val kơi rau tabech galang bhral tââq Yaang Pleng, chadrươh nek rau bhơt liêm, lơq rau sek liêm, palơq rau paq klóóih koom đóng nôôq he. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Hơq đóng, kơi ve paraaq xaraq: “Ngaai pajơơr ađêi, phaai pajơơr ađêi kalóóng Chuôq.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó, bhêêl tơk palơq adhi anó, aku kung ơi kah vôôiq palơq rau dhơuq yaal ưng paraaq bóóp môôiq ưng rau tabech galang, xók truuih karơ đóng adhi anó rau dhơuq lââp ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Taai tơơt m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó, aku ơi dhakơi kah n'nal rauriq chapiên Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq Ađó ơi bâân tateeng đinh dhiq n'lóóng m'baang chatông. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Aku kung ơi tơơt palơq adhi anó kalóóng rau dhur lóóm, kalóóng vaaih kakhin kapơn lơq hayer hatơq bhlơng. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Paraaq praaq ưng aku lơq rau truuih pachóóm ưng aku kah đuôh mơ nôôq gluh paraaq palââng đơơp xâng ưng lóóm karnóq bhriêl tabech, bơơi nek palơq rau pakah lêi ưng Yaang Liêm lơq mataai raman, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />buôn lóóm huuiq adhi anó yươq tơơt dhiq rau tabech galang ưng akóón manưih, hơq nek dhiq mataai raman ưng Yaang pleng.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Bơơi m'pơng nôôq manưih taha tabech, nôôq yi truuih rau tabech galang, hơq eh rau rau tabech galang ưng đơơi ađôk, kung eh rau ưng nôôq manưih kadhâng akoq đơơi ađôk, nek nôôq manưih bâân chêt bil aq. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, nôôq yi truuih pachóóm rau tabech galang ưng Yaang Pleng, kalóóng rau lalââp, nek rau ơi bâân takadrêi lââp hơq Yaang Pleng ơi ravang lơơi tââq laloom nôôq klaang đơơi koom đóng rau cha-iil tabah ưng nôôq he, <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />nek rau hơq kah mưi ngaai kalóóng nôôq kabhuh kadhâng akoq ưng đơơi ađôk bâân n'nal, ơi la piđó n'nal, nek hơq alua piđó ơi kah teeng đinh Chuôq cha-iil tabah dhiq m'baang chatông. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Dhơ kơi ađek, kơi ve paraaq xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Rau mat kah lêi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">katór kah xâng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">lơq kah yuur vaaih kalóóng lóóm manưih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">nek nôôq rau hơq Yaang Pleng ơi ravang lơơi đóng nôôq ngaai nh'nhơr Ađó.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Tââq Yaang Pleng ơi pakah đóng nôôq yi dhiq Yaang Liêm. Taai Yaang liêm chamet lêi dyóp rau, chênh tabhơt nôôq rau lââp dhơuq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ơi ngaai m'pơng kalóóng akóón manưih bâân n'nal nôôq rau kalóóng mưi chanak, la eh rau nek lóóm karnóq ưng manưih ađek hót kalóóng achak ađêi? Kung kơi achêk, kah ngaai đơơp n'nal nôôq rau mađó ưng Yaang Pleng, chapiên Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Bơơi nôôq yi kah ơi đơơp đươi yaang ưng manưih hóng katiêk ađôk, hơq nek Yaang Liêm bhral tââq Yaang Pleng, buôn nôôq yi ve chóóm n'nal nôôq rau bâân đóng kliim kagóh tââq Yaang Pleng đóng nôôq he. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Kung nek nôôq rau hơq nôôq yi truuih pachóóm, eh rau palơq rau pató pachóóm tââq nôôq paraaq bóóp tabech galang ưng akóón manưih, bơơi nek palơq rau pató pachóóm ưng Yaang Liêm, xók kluôh pakah nôôq rau đuui Chuôq tââq nôôq paraaq đuui Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Nôôq manưih ting kơi ng'kar m'bech kaxu nek kah pei đơơp nôôq rau mađó leq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, taai piđó nek rau ngôôk ngaak nek palơq manưih achêk, lơq manưih achêk kah ve chóóm đuôh buôn n'nal tââq piđó phaai bâân chamet lêi, ting kơi đuui Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Hayơq manưih đuui Chuôq chamet lêi dyóp rau, bơơi chênh ađêi nek yươq bâân ngaai chamet lêi.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />“Ơi ngaai bâân n'nal lóóm karnóq ưng Chuôq — ngaai e chaleq pachóóm Chuôq?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Bơơi nôôq he nek ve lóóm karnóq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku vil kah chóóm praaq palơq adhi anó kơi palơq nôôq manưih đuui Chuôq, bơơi nek kơi palơq nôôq akóón manưih ti, kơi palơq nôôq akóón n'niên par-aang kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Aku ơi đóng adhi anó ơm đơơk toh hơq eh rau chana kók, taai adhi anó kah ve chóóm đuôh. Kơi achêk hơq, patơk mơ xók ađôk adhi anó kung kah ve chóóm đuôh. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Taai adhi anó kung dyơq lóóm manưih ti. Tââq dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, nek dhiq ve lóóm rau makhinh lơq tarkaai tarvei, nek kah alua adhi anó nek lóóm manưih ti, lơq tơơt cha kơi manưih đơơi? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Tââq, xók manưih ađô praaq: “Aku mađó leq Phaau-lô,” hayơq manưih lââng: “Aku mađó ưng A-bô-lô,” nek kah alua adhi anó nek manưih đơơi? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Kơi achêk nek, A-bô-lô nek ngaai? Hayơq Phaau-lô nek ngaai? Nek nôôq dhơn ratơơq, hơq adhi anó ve lóóm huuiq tââq piđó, patơk mơ ting mak dhiq Yaang Pleng ơi patơơt đóng ting chanak. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Aku ơi choh, A-bô-lô ơi rah, bơơi Yaang Pleng têêng đóng gamak yaal. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Kơi achêk hayơq, eh rau manưih choh, kung eh rau manưih rah nek kah rauriq. Bơơi Yaang têêng đóng gamak yaal nek Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Hayơq manưih choh lơq manưih rah nek mưi, bơơi ting chanak e bâân đơơp jêên makông ađêi ting mơ rau galeh nhok ưng achak araang. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Taai nôôq yi nek nôôq parjơơk marau tarnêêng mađó leq Yaang Pleng. Adhi anó nek kalung klung ưng Yaang Pleng, dhanong đong ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ting mơ ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq aku, aku ơi têêng bhanơn thê kơi manưih têêng kala ragêi tarnêêng, hayơq ngaai lââng yuur kadhơng dhiq m'piing ađek. Bơơi ting chanak phaai chagơn leq kơi ađêi yuur kadhơng dhiq papiing. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Ơi kah ngaai ve chóóm bhơn mưi bhanơn lââng lơh tââq bhanơn bâân bhơn, hơq ađek nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, la ve ngaai kadhơng papiing bhanơn achêk palơq vaang, baak, dhơl kiiq, n'lóóng, bhơơi rang, n'drang, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />nek tarnêêng ưng ting chanak e val kơi giit lơh, taai tangêi achêk e gluh pakah; tââq ađó bâân tapakah kalóóng óih; lơq chênh óih e klêêu lêi tarnêêng ưng dyóp ngaai ve harau tarnêêng parvôôiq. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />La tarnêêng ưng ngaai bhiêk dyơq lóóiq, đu nek tarnêêng hơq manưih ađek ơi kadhơng, nek manưih ađek e bâân đơơp kaliim haanh; <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />la tarnêêng ưng ngaai bâân róh bil, nek manưih ađek e đơơp hư bil, hayơq chênh ađêi e bâân paq, bơơi ting kơi thê ngóq palơh óih.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi adhi anó nek đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng lơq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng mamông kalóóng ađêi alua? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />La ngaai manưih têêng pahư đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang Pleng e têêng pahư manưih achêk. Taai đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng nek tabah liêm, hơq đong bhanuôih achêk nek adhi anó.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Óóq ngaai tư galơơk chachââr ađêi. La ngaai manưih kalóóng adhi anó ve ngóq kơi nek tabech galang dhiq klaang ađôk, nek manưih achêk phaai lơơi đóng ađêi val xar “manưih ngôôk” hơq đóng ve chóóm bâân val xar tabech galang. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ơi rau tabech galang ưng manưih hóng katiêk ađôk nek rau ngôôk ngaak toom mat Yaang Pleng. Taai ve paraaq xaraq, kơi ađô: “Ađó kóóp kadhâng nôôq manưih tabech kalóóng rau galang bhriêl ưng piđó.”<verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Lơq vil ve xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 3:20">“Chuôq n'nal nôôq paraaq pakah ưng nôôq manưih tabech galang; kơi piđó nek kah rau malơơi.”<verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kơi achêk hayơq, óóq ngaai pakah pajơơr dhiq akóón manưih, Taai pabhơt nek ưng adhi anó, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />dhơ nek Phaau-lô, môôiq A-bô-lô, môôiq Sê-pha, dhơ nek talaang katiêk, môôiq rau parmông, môôiq rau chêt, môôiq tarnêêng xók ve, môôiq tarnêêng ravang bhral. Tabhơt maar mađó leq adhi anó, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />hayơq adhi anó mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq Chuôq Paq Manưih mađó leq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Taai kơi ađek, ting chanak phaai lêi nôôq yi kơi nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq nôôq manưih jư lêi nôôq rau lalââp ưng Yaang pleng. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Hayơq tarlum kadhaap dhiq ađô, achêk nek rau bâân mââl nhan dhiq nôôq manưih jư lêi nek ng'kơi đóng dyóp ngaai bâân lêi nek yươq tadhơ. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Bơơi tarlum kadhaap ađô nek chiên kuôq katưưiq katit nek palơq aku, dhơ đóng aku ve chóóm bâân chamet lêi tââq adhi anó môôiq tââq kabhuh kadhâng xanêi ưng akóón manưih, Mat lââng, aku kung kah tư chamet lêi achak ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Ơi aku đơơp lêi yươq ve rau tarlum kadhaap jaklâk huông ađêi kala, dhơ kơi ađek aku kah bâân đóók bhơt liêm đươi tarnêêng achêk; bơơi Chuôq nek Yaang chamet lêi aku. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Kơi achêk hayơq, óóq xêi lơt hau rau laloom tơk gani, nek tơk xók Chuôq bhral, nek Yaang chadrươh e đââng nôôq tarnêêng kadrêi lââp ưng rau kanam kanheet gluh leq brương, chadrươh e pakah nôôq karnóq kaniêng kalóóng lóóm. Hayơq mót bhêêl ađek, rau bhi haanh tââq Yaang Pleng e tơk palơq ting chanak.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku ơi pei têêng nôôq rau ađô nek palơq chênh ađêi lơq A-bô-lô, taai malơơi ưng adhi anó, buôn tââq nôôq yi, adhi anó ve chóóm hok n'nal xayar ađô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 4:6">“Óóq bhalóng lơh paraaq ơi xaraq,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 4:6">hơq đóng óóq mưi ngaai yuur laach jơơr ađêi vơn dhanóók manưih ađô jaklâk lóóiq manưih tôôh. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ơi ngaai têêng blah adhi anó tablah xóng ađêi? Mat lââng, hau rau adhi anó ơi ve hơq ađêi ơi kah bâân đơơp? Bơơi la adhi anó ơi đơơp, nek ng'kơi adhi anó vil laach jơơr kơi ngóq kah ơi đơơp? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Adhi anó nek ơi bâân dyóp aq! Adhi anó ơi val kơi kabhôôq karvaan aq, adhi anó ơi ravang kađââng akoq hơq kah đươi nôôq yi, lơq aku rââm adhi anó lalua kađââng akoq, buôn nôôq yi kung ve chóóm kađââng akoq makơi palơq adhi anó! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Ơi aku ve kanóq Yaang Pleng ơi pakah nôôq yi gluh têêng nôôq sưưq-đô tatun kiêt, kơi nôôq manưih bâân tabóq matu leng chêt. Taai nôôq yi ơi val xar mưi tarnêêng têêng pacheh đóng manưih hóng katiêk, lơq đóng dhơn Yaang Pleng palơq đóng dhong nooi manưih. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Nôôq yi nek ngôôk khơl ơi taai Chuôq Paq Manưih, hayơq adhi anó nek tabech galang kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. Nôôq yi dhur lóóm, hayơq adhi anó nek grâ karơ. Adhi anó bâân bhi chap, hayơq nôôq yi bâân kađiq kađiêp. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Đóng tơk bhêêl ađôk, nôôq yi lơq jruôn ha-ul, đơơp rahaal, lơq xơp n'đóh bhatuui taai, lơq bâân tambhiiq m'pah jarnah jakaal, lơq kah ve dhiq tơơt ra-iên, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />lơq têêng vôôiq nhưh nhok, têêng tarnêêng palơq chênh bơơr beq têi ađêi. Xók bâân tóh taaiq, nôôq yi nhan phươk. Xók bâân janah leng, nôôq yi đơơp jruôn. <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />Xók bâân baauq uôn, nôôq yi bhơơl pahêêl. Nôôq yi ơi val xar kơi nôôq rau n'đoh n'đương ưng manưih hóng katiêk, ưng dyóp rau n'đoh n'đương, đóng tơk xariêq tangêi ađôk.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Aku kah xaraq nôôq paraaq ađôk buôn têêng kachiit mat adhi anó, bơơi aku bhơơl pachóóm adhi anó kơi akóón bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ơi dhơ adhi anó ve kaaq bhaan manưih kađââng kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek kung kah ve bơk ama; tââq aku ơi yuur n'niên adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih đươi Taruuih Liêm. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Kơi achêk, aku mââl bhơơl adhi anó phaai val kơi nôôq manưih ting đuui aku. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Taai ơi rau ađôk aku kayua Ti-mô-thê vôôiq, hơq nek panong akóón bơk nh'nhơr lơq bhơt lóóm huuiq ưng aku kalóóng Chuôq, tơk palơq adhi anó. Ađó achêk e praaq pahei adhi anó leq nôôq ploong kalơng ưng aku kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, dhalam kơi aku ơi truuih pachóóm dhiq kalóóng Kabhuh Akóón Dhơn Chuôq plok dyóp dhiq. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Dhơ kơi ađek, kơi ngóq taai aku kah tơk palơq adhi anó, hayơq mưi phơn manưih ơi yuur laach jơơr ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Bơơi aku e đâh vôôiq palơq adhi anó, la Chuôq kiêng, lơq aku e bâân n'nal, eh rau paraaq praaq ưng nôôq manưih laach jơơr tôôh, bơơi nek praan kataai ưng piđó. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ơi katiêk Yaang Pleng eh rau dhiq paraaq praaq, bơơi nek dhiq karơ mataai. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Adhi anó kiêng harau? Aku kơng tơk palơq adhi anó palơq m'beq rooi, môôiq palơq lóóm tanhơr lơq lóóm karnóq moor dha-iiq?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Tarlum kadhaap lalua bâân xâng praaq dhiq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó nek mưi tarnêêng tapiing taniêt, lơq kơi tapiing taniêt kơi achêk nek rau patơk mơ kah ve dhiq m'pơng kalóóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk palââng. Tơk mơ hơq mưi chanak tôôh pei kađiêl ưng ama ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Hayơq adhi anó nek bhiêk laach jơơr, vil dhaang kah rau mơ kalau nhiim, hơq đóng manưih ơi têêng tarnêêng achêk ve chóóm bâân m'peq lơơi tââq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ơi aku, dhơ changaai kalóóng achak araang bơơi ve mat kalóóng lóóm karnóq, ơi tabóq matu manưih têêng matu mơ achêk ơi, kơi ngóq dyơq ve mat tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Kalóóng dhanóók Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, xók adhi anó ơi bâân nhoom karong lóóiq, palơq lóóm karnóq ưng aku, palơq karơ mataai ưng Chuôq nôôq he nek Chuôq Jê-su, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />buôn pajaau manưih ađek đóng Sa-taan hơq đơơp rau leng pahư phơn achak, ng'kơi đóng lóóm ravaai ađó ađek ve chóóm bâân paq kalóóng tangêi ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Rau laach jơơr ưng adhi anó kah rau liêm kre. Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi m'bưưiq piêng têêng paxơơk tabhơt mapơq amun alua? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Phaai kajut pasek piêng ti, buôn adhi anó ve chóóm nek mapơq amun tame, thê kơi adhi anó nek beng kah mapiêng. Taai Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek trưưu akóón Bhiêk Jalơh ưng nôôq he, kung ơi bâân leng têêng dhah bhanuôih. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Kơi achêk hayơq, nôôq he phaai tơơt bhiêk, eh rau palơq piêng ti, kung eh rau palơq piêng chachââr galơơk, lơq têêng aak, bơơi nek palơq beng kah mapiêng ưng rau lóóm taniih lalua lơq paraaq dhalam.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Kalóóng bha-aar aku ơi xaraq đóng adhi anó nek óóq tơơt charjơơk palơq manưih têêng tapiing. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Parpâng eh rau nôôq manưih têêng tapiing ưng manưih hóng katiêk ađôk, môôiq nek manưih n'thaam jahaam, lơq malua, môôiq nôôq manưih bhuôih kabhêi, taai kơi achêk, adhi anó kơng phaai yuur gluh tââq manưih hóng katiêk. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Bơơi kơi xók ađôk, aku ơi xaraq đóng adhi anó óóq tơơt charjơơk palơq dhơ dhangaai manưih đu bâân đóók nek adhi anó hơq nek manưih têêng tapiing, n'thaam jahaam, bhuôih kabhêi, keen tóh taaiq, ból plơ, môôiq chachââr galơơk. Patơk mơ kung óóq cha madhiq palơq mưi manưih kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Taai xêi lơt nôôq manưih tơơt nguôi harau pâng tơk aku? Adhi anó kah xêi lơt nôôq manưih dhiq kalóóng alua? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng e xêi lơt nôôq manưih dhiq tôôh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 5:13">“Phaai m'peq lơơi rau lơt aak tââq m'pơng chênh adhi anó.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Xók ve bhiêk chiên huông palơq manưih lââng, ngaai ađek kalóóng adhi anó khin lơơi bâân xêi lơt toom mat nôôq manưih kah liêm, hơq eh rau toom mat nôôq manưih huuiq liêm alua? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal kơi nôôq manưih huuiq liêm e xêi lơt manưih hóng katiêk? Lơq la manưih hóng katiêk e bâân xêi lơt tââq adhi anó, nek adhi anó kah dyóp praan karơ leq nôôq kaauq bhiêk chiên kuôq katưưiq-katit ađô alua? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi nôôq he e xêi lơt nôôq dhơn Pleng alua? Hau praaq tơk nôôq tarlum kadhaap ưng đơơi ađôk? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Kơi achêk nek, dhơ adhi anó ve nôôq kaauq bhiêk chiên mađó leq đơơi ađôk, hau kơi adhi anó patơơt nôôq manưih ađek tơơt xêi xanêi, hơq nek nôôq manưih bâân lêi kah rau ve phơn kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Aku xók praaq leq rau đaang kachiit mat ưng adhi anó. Kơi achêk ve kơq kah ve ngaai manưih tabech galang kalóóng adhi anó, nek manưih e ve chóóm xêi praaq tơơt m'pơng adhi anó ađêi alua? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Palâh lóóiq, adhi anó ađô đơơp yuur pakah xêi xanêi huông lóóiq adhi anó tôôh, lơq rau bhiêk chiên ađek dhiq toom mat nôôq manưih kah huuiq! <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Kơi achêk hayơq, tarlum chiên ađô biêh nek mưi rau kah tarting pabhơt nek palơq adhi anó ơi. Taai adhi anó ve nôôq bhiêk chiên kaauq m'pơng chênh ađêi. Taai hau n'jang nek đơơp bil? Taai hau n'jang nek đơơp galơơk chachââr? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó praaq têêng lơt môôp lơq kamuuch kanam, hayơq têêng kơi achêk palơq adhi anó ađêi! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal kơi manưih kah liêm e kah bâân pei đươi katiêk Yaang Pleng? Óóq lơơi bâân galơơk chachââr; kah ngaai manưih têêng tapiing, manưih bhuôih kabhêi, manưih têêng taniêt, padruuih baan achak, manưih đơơp pađiil xóng pađiil padruuih xóng padruuih, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />manưih tatông papei, manưih n'thaam, manưih ból plơ, manưih baauq uôn, môôiq manưih bhlơp galơơk, e kah bâân đươi katiêk Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Lơq mưi phơn kalóóng adhi anó ơi glêh kơi achêk. Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó ơi bâân raau kajut, ơi bâân liêm sek, ơi bâân đóók bhơt liêm kalóóng dhanóók Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq tââq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng nôôq he.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />“Dyóp rau nek palơq aku nek chóóm pheep têêng,” bơơi eh alua dyóp rau đââng tơk malơơi. “Dyóp rau nek palơq aku nek chóóm pheep têêng,” bơơi aku e kah têêng xól tââq bhơt dhơ dharau. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />“Chana dhanah đóng leq palung, lơq palung đóng leq chana dhanah,” bơơi Yaang Pleng e pahư tabil bhơt beq ađô lơq beq tôôh. Bơơi achak araang eh rau đóng leq rau kiêng tapiing, hơq đóng leq Chuôq, lơq Chuôq đóng leq achak araang. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Yaang Pleng ơi têêng Chuôq mamông lóóiq, kung e têêng nôôq he mamông lóóiq tââq karơ mataai ưng Ađó. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi achak araang ađêi nek maphơn achak ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih alua? Kơi achêk nek, xong xók pei maphơn achak ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, aku chóóm paxar piđó xar maphơn achak ưng pađiil baan achak? Kah chóóm mơ ve chiên ađek! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal kơi ngaai tơơt jum chênh ađêi palơq pađiil baan achak nek mưi ng'kar m'bech palơq ađó? Ơi ve xaraq: “Bơơr chanak e val xar mưi ng'kar m'bech.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Bơơi ngaai tơơt jum chênh ađêi palơq Chuôq hơq nek mưi achak đuui Chuôq palơq Ađó. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Phaai viêr changaai rau tapiing taniêt! Dyóp rau matu hơq palââng têêng ve kơq nek tơơt dhiq nguôi achak araang, bơơi manưih têêng rau tapiing taniêt nek têêng lơt palơq chênh achak araang ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Môôiq adhi anó kah n'nal kơi achak araang ađêi nek đong bhanuôih ưng Chuôq Yaang Liêm tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, nek Yaang hơq adhi anó đơơp tââq Yaang Pleng? Lơq adhi anó eh mađó leq chênh ađêi, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />taai adhi anó ơi bâân pók kơl palơq janaaq yaal ơi. Taai kơi achêk, phaai têêng cha-iil tabah Yaang Pleng palơq achak araang ađêi.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Hayơq leq nôôq rau hơq adhi anó ơi xaraq: “Alua liêm đóng manưih padruuih yươq bêch tơơt palơq pađiil.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Bơơi taai dharơơl galơơk têêng taniêt, ting chanak padruuih phaai pei kađiêl đóng ađêi, lơq ting chanak pađiil phaai pei kayiik đóng ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Kayiik phaai têêng paxong tarnêêng nek palơq kađiêl, hayơq kađiêl nek palơq kayiik kung thê kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Kađiêl kah ve chóóm kala dhiq achak araang ưng ađêi, bơơi nek kayiik. Hơq thê kơi achêk, kayiik kung kah ve chóóm kala dhiq achak araang ưng ađêi, bơơi nek kađiêl. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Óóq jơl châq xóng ađêi, chapiên nek tââq rau markơi lóóm kalóóng mưi ganah ve mơ gani buôn adhi anó ve chóóm bhơt lóóm gavơh nhan, Hayơq val tơơt maleq xóng ađêi, hơq đóng Sa-taan óóq ve chóóm dharơơl galơơk adhi anó tââq rau kah đuôh pakala ưng ađêi.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, aku praaq rau ađô kơi mưi rau đơơp pathua, eh rau kơi paraaq râng. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Bơơi aku rââm dyóp ngaai patơk mơ bâân kơi aku. Dhơ kơi achêk, dyóp ngaai ve ơơn n'tua tââq Yaang Pleng, dhơ ve ngaai kơi ađô, bơơi ve ngaai kơi lââng. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Hayơq nek palơq nôôq manưih kah ơi bâân manưih lơq nôôq đu kamaai, aku móón kơi la piđó bhiêk dyơq tơơt kơi aku nek liêm. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Bơơi la piđó kah gơt jư ađêi đuôh, nek piđó phaai bâân manưih. Ơi bâân manưih nek liêm lơh jruôn bơơi lóóm kiêng. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Hayơq nek palơq nôôq ngaai ơi bâân manưih nek aku praaq kayua, eh rau aku, hơq nek Chuôq, kơi kađiêl kah đơơp tarlơơi tââq kayiik, <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />(bơơi patơk mơ la pađiil achêk ơi bâân tarlơơi, nek ađó phaai bhiêk tơơt kah bâân manưih, môôiq phaai paliêm lóóiq palơq kayiik), lơq kayiik nek kah lơơi kađiêl. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Bơơi nek palơq nôôq manưih dyơq lóóiq nek aku kayua, aku, hơq eh rau Chuôq, la ngaai adhi anó ve kađiêl kah ơi huuiq, lơq pađiil achêk iêm lóóm mamông palơq ađêi, nek adhi anó kah chóóm pheep lơơi pađiil achêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />La mưi pađiil ngaai ve kayiik kah ơi huuiq lơq manưih achêk markơi lóóm mamông palơq ađêi, nek kađiêl kah chóóm lơơi kayiik. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Taai kayiik kah ơi huuiq bâân sek liêm tââq kađiêl ađêi, lơq kađiêl kah ơi huuiq bâân sek liêm tââq manưih adhi anó ađek. Ơi la kah nek akóón anaaq adhi anó nek kah sek liêm, bơơi xók ađôk piđó bâân liêm. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Hayơq la manưih kah huuiq ađek tư ađó tablah, phaai lơơi manưih achêk bâân tablah. Manưih adhi anó môôiq adhi anó achêk yươq bâân pa-eep kalóóng rau tarlum ađek, hơq nek Yaang Pleng ơi dhaloong nôôq he tơơt kalóóng nôôq yươq rauha. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Ơi, nhan móón adhi anó, ng'kơi têêng adhi anó n'nal la ve kơi adhi anó e bâân paq kayiik ađêi? Môôiq, adhi anó ơơi, ng'kơi têêng adhi anó n'nal la ve kơi adhi anó e bâân paq kađiêl ađêi? <verse eid="1CO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />La kah ve, nek Chuôq ơi nh'xóóng đóng leq ting chanak n'đó kơi, Yaang Pleng ơi dhaloong ting chanak ng'kơi, phaai jađaang vôôiq kơi achêk. Lơq aku đóng pheep kơi achêk kalóóng tabhơt nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ngaai ơi bâân dhaloong xong xók đơơp iêt ng'kar kơq? Manưih achêk óóq kơi kah ơi iêt ng'kar. Ngaai ơi bâân dhaloong xók tarlum kah ơi iêt ng'kar kơq? Manưih ađek óóq đơơp iêt ng'kar. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Iêt ng'kar nek kah rau, kah iêt ng'kar kung nek kah rau; hơq liêm tââm nek rau huuiq jư nôôq gani pachóóm ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Ting chanak manưih, kalóóng dhariêng dhaloong hơq ađêi ơi bâân dhaloong, phaai bhiêk xalia kalóóng tarnơơt achêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Adhi anó bâân dhaloong kalóóng manưih têêng xól kơq? Óóq lơơi rau ađek têêng đóng adhi anó karaang. Dhơ kơi ađek, la adhi anó alua ve chóóm val kơi rathaai, nek phaai kapươk dyuôch xók ve bâân. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ơi mưi chanak, nek têêng xól, bâân dhaloong kalóóng Chuôq nek val xar manưih rathaai ưng Chuôq. Kung kơi achêk, manưih rathaai bâân dhaloong nek val xar têêng xól ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Adhi anó ơi bâân pók kơl palơq janaaq yaal ơi; óóq val xar têêng xól ưng akóón manưih. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Nhan móón lơq adhi anó, ting chanak tơơt kalóóng tarlum dhađó dhiq xók bâân dhaloong, nek phaai bhiêk tơơt palơq Yaang Pleng kalóóng tarlum dhiq ađek.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Bơơi tapâng tơk nôôq manưih tơơt laleh, aku kah ve paraaq kayua ưng Chuôq. Dhơ kơi ađek, aku pakah kanóq paraaq taai ơi bâân đơơp ơơn kayô ka-er tââq Chuôq buôn têêng mưi manưih đaang huuiq ganơơm. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Taai kơi ađek aku đóng kơi tarlum kơi achêk nek liêm, ơi taai rau kadhaap kara hat ơi tơk pađan, kơi alua liêm đóng mưi ngaai bhiêk tơơt dhiq pâng tarlum kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Alua kơq adhi anó bâân tachauq palơq kađiêl? Óóq tabâân kơi tarlơơi. Alua kơq adhi anó bâân tarlơơi tââq kađiêl? Óóq bâân kađiêl. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Hayơq la adhi anó bâân kađiêl, nek adhi anó yươq têêng matu; lơq la mưi pađiil kamór bâân kayiik, nek pađiil achêk yươq têêng matu. Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq manưih kơi achêk e ve vaaih kadhaap jarnah kalóóng ng'kar m'bech, hơq aku kiêng adhi anó viêr rau ađek. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Bơơi, nhan móón adhi anó, aku kayua rau ađô: tangêi kaxe nek ơi bâân êêp gađóq, hơq đóng tââq ađôk leq tabhêêl, pabhơt nôôq ngaai ve kađiêl, nek xar kơi kah ve; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />nôôq ngaai nhiim, nek kơi kah nhiim; ngaai bhuui marhaal, nek kơi kah bhuui; nôôq ngaai kơl ravang, nek kơi kah bâân rau pakala; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Lơq nôôq ngaai n'dróh karvaan akóón manưih hóng katiêk, nek kơi kah rau đươi. Ơi rau lêi ưng hóng katiêk ađôk e lơh bil. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Mat lââng, aku rââm kiêng adhi anó bâân yươq nhok-nhói. Manưih tơơt laleh yươq karaang lóóm nôôq rau mađó leq Chuôq, n'đó kơi hơq ađêi ve chóóm têêng bhuui lóóm Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Bơơi manưih padruuih ơi bâân kađiêl karaang lóóm nôôq tarnêêng ưng đơơi ađôk, n'đó kơi manưih kayiik ve chóóm têêng bhuui lóóm kađiêl ađêi, lơq manưih ađek bâân paangra. Pađiil tơơt laleh môôiq pađiil kamór <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />karaang lóóm nôôq rau mađó leq Chuôq, ng'kơi đóng ađêi ve chóóm bâân sek liêm miq kalóóng achak araang lơq kalóóng lóóm ravaai. Bơơi pađiil ơi bâân kayiik karaang lóóm nôôq tarnêêng ưng đơơi ađôk, n'đó kơi manưih kađiêl ve chóóm têêng bhuui lóóm kayiik ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Dhơ kơi ađek, aku dyơq praaq rau ađô ơi malơơi ưng chênh adhi anó, eh rau buôn aku ve chóóm dhoong biêng pajư adhi anó, bơơi buôn malóóm tơk rau têêng yaauq chênh ađaang lơq kanóq lóóm đóng Chuôq mưi kơi yươq lơơi havil. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Bơơi la ngaai manưih đóng kơi xók têêng praaq kah dhalam ting palơq akóón pađiil kamór ưng ađêi, alua kơq pađiil achêk ve nh'jau bâân chaguui lơq taai kơi achêk tarnêêng bâân kayiik bâân yuur vaaih, nek manưih achêk phaai têêng rau ađêi rââm kiêng. Manưih achêk yươq têêng matu; phaai lơơi piđó bâân kayiik. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Hayơq ngaai đuôh pakala kalóóng lóóm ađêi, yươq ve rau chut kajuq, hơq ve kataai dhiq karnóq kiêng ưng chênh ađêi, lơq manưih achêk ơi đóng pheep kơi achêk kalóóng lóóm ađêi, buôn jư lêi akóón pađiil kamór ưng ađêi, nek manưih achêk e têêng praaq kơi dhalam. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kơi achêk, manưih đóng akóón pađiil kamór ađêi têêng dhalam, lơq manưih kah đóng patơk mơ e têêng liêm lơh. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Manưih kađiêl bâân tachauq bhluuch mơ đươnh kayiik ađêi dyơq mamông. Bơơi la kayiik chêt nek pađiil achêk bâân rathaai bâân kayiik palơq ngaai manưih ađêi kiêng, bhiêk nek kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ting kanóq paraaq ưng aku nek pađiil achêk bâân phươk lơh la ve chóóm bhiêk tơơt kơi achêk. Bơơi, aku kanóq kơi ađô ađêi kung ve Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Leq nôôq rau bhuôih đóng kabhêi: Nôôq he n'nal kơi pabhơt nôôq he ve tarbech. Tarbech nek têêng laach jơơr, bơơi lóóm tanhơr nek têêng tahayuur. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />La ngaai ngóq ađêi n'nal rauriq ađek, nek manưih achêk kah ơi n'nal kơi ađêi chóóm n'nal. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Bơơi la ngaai bhi nh'nhơr Yaang Pleng, nek manưih ađek bâân Ađó n'nal. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Kơi achêk, leq tarnêêng cha nôôq rau bhanuôih bhuôih đóng kabhêi: Nôôq he n'nal kơi kabhêi kalóóng hóng katiêk nek hư bil, lơq kơi kah ve n'đó yaang liêm lââng lơh tââq Yaang Dhalam mưi giêl. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ơi dhơ nek pajra móón ve nôôq rau bâân đóók nek yaang, môôiq têêh dhiq pleng môôiq dhiq katiêk, thê kơi ve bơk “yaang” lơq bơk “chuôq,” <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />bơơi nek palơq nôôq he, chapiên ve mưi Yaang Pleng nek Ama, Yaang hơq nek tââq tavaaih dyóp rau, lơq nek Yaang hơq nôôq he taluôn kanóq tơk; palơq mưi Chuôq nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, đươi Ađó hơq dyóp rau bâân yuur tavaaih, lơq đươi Ađó hơq nôôq he bâân tavaaih ve.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Dhơ kơi ađek, tarbech ađôk kah tơơt kalóóng dyóp ngaai. Bơơi bơk ngaai tôôh ting lóóm keen tââq n'loom tơk ađôk palơq kabhêi, piđó cha nôôq rau achêk kơi ngóq rau ơi bâân bhuôih leq kabhêi, hayơq lóóm kanóq biêh dhur lóóm ưng piđó ơi bâân anhuq. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Mat lââng, chana dhanah e kah đââng nôôq he tơk đan Yaang Pleng; La kah cha, nôôq he kung yươq hat tabhuch, la cha nôôq he kung kah rau lơh. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Bơơi phaai chagơn, e ngaai kơi-kiq ađek, lóóm rathaai ađô ưng adhi anó vaaih val xar têêng paxruuk đóng manưih dhur lóóm. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ơi la ngaai ađek bâân lêi manưih ve tarbech tơơt cha kalóóng đong bhanuôih bhuôih kabhêi, nek eh rau lóóm karnóq biêh dhur lóóm ưng piđó e bâân yua chut buôn cha nôôq rau bâân bhuôih đóng kabhêi alua? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Kơi achêk nek, mưi chanak dhur lóóm, mưi chanak adhi anó hơq Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi chêt klóóih, bâân pahư tabil tââq tarbech ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Mat lââng, ting kơi ađek, xók têêng matu huông palơq nôôq adhi anó ađêi lơq têêng tabhrê karnóq lóóm dhur lóóm ưng piđó, nek adhi anó têêng matu huông palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Hayơq nek la chana dhanah têêng đóng mưi chanak adhi anó ưng aku kanóq lơt, nek aku dhơ dhakơi e kah ve mơ đah adhah, hơq đóng aku óóq têêng lơt đóng manưih adhi anó ưng ađêi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Aku kah bâân rathaai alua? Aku eh rau nek mưi sưưq-đô alua? Aku kah glêh lum Chuôq Jê-su, Chuôq nôôq he alua? Kah alua adhi anó nek tarnêêng ưng aku kalóóng Chuôq alua? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Dhơ aku eh rau nek sưưq-đô nek palơq manưih lââng, bơơi bhơt m'bưưiq aku nek sưưq-đô nek palơq adhi anó. Ơi adhi anó nek karnal leq tarnêêng têêng sưưq-đô ưng aku kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Paraaq ââi paq ưng aku nek palơq nôôq manưih tamóh aku nek nô kơi: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Ve kơq nôôq yi kah ve chóóm cha lơq ơm? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ve kơq nôôq yi kah ve chóóm ting đââng mưi manưih kađiêl huuiq Chuôq, kung kơi nôôq sưưq-đô lââng palơq nôôq manưih adhi padruuih ưng Chuôq lơq Sê-pha? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Môôiq chapiên mưi Ba-na-ba lơq aku kah ve chóóm kah têêng tarnêêng? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Ngaai vôôiq linh palơq chaner đong ađêi mơ? Ngaai choh bhươn nho hơq kah cha pale ađó? Môôiq ngaai ban bhanan hơq kah ơm đơơk toh ưng bhanan? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Eh rau aku xók praaq nôôq rau ađô ting kơi manưih đơơi alua? Môôiq gani kung kah praaq nôôq rau achêk? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Ơi ve paraaq xaraq kalóóng gani Môôi-se: “Óóq xróp xaróp leq buum akóón karók xók đâq aviq.” Ve kơq Yaang Pleng gamang đóng akóón karók? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Môôiq Ađó praaq pabhơt taai malơơi ưng nôôq he? Alua, paraaq bâân xaraq taai malơơi ưng nôôq he, kơi manưih têêng hare phaai têêng kalóóng lóóm rââm, lơq manưih đâq aviq nek têêng kalóóng rau rââm đương leq phơn blah đóng ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />La nôôq yi ơi chóói nôôq rau đuui Chuôq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó, nek ve kuôq lalơh kah la nôôq yi e xóót leh nôôq rau manưih ti tââq adhi anó? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />La nôôq manưih lââng ve phơn leq kataai ađek dhiq adhi anó, nek eh alua nôôq yi dhaang bơk lơh! Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq yi kah kapươk kataai ađôk. Klóóih leq ađek, nôôq yi đơơp jruôn dyóp rau buôn nôôq yi yươq đââng tơk dhơ dharau n'đó garóóng chađơl đóng Taruuih Liêm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi nôôq ngaai têêng yaauq kalóóng đong bhanuôih nek cha nôôq rau mađó đong bhanuôih, nôôq manưih têêng yaauq dhiq baang bhanuôih nek ve phơn dhiq baang bhanuôih, môôiq alua? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Kung mưi kơi ađek, Chuôq ơi truuih pachóóm kơi nôôq manưih truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm nek mamông đươi Taruuih Liêm. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Bơơi aku kah kapươk bhơt dhơ dhađó rau kalóóng nôôq kataai ađek. Mat lââng, aku kah xaraq nôôq paraaq ađô buôn kataai achêk bâân tapâng đóng ađêi kơi achêk, taai nek palơq aku, n'jang chêt dyơq lơh nek bhơt dhơ dhangaai e têêng đóng rau tarhơơnh ưng aku vaaih hư bil. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ơi la aku truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm, nek kah ve rau đóng aku buôn tarhơơnh, taai têêng paxong phơn bâân lơơi patơơt dhiq aku. Ơi alua nek ayô xarngaat đóng aku la aku kah truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />La aku ravang lóóm têêng tarnêêng achêk, nek aku bâân kaliim haanh. Hayơq la kah ravang lóóm, nek aku ơi đơơp pajaau tarnêêng têêng ơi jư lêi đong. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Kơi achêk, kaliim haanh ưng aku nek hau? Ađek nek xók truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm kah pei jêên, aku ve chóóm truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm ng'kơi đóng óóq n'dróh kataai ưng ađêi kalóóng Taruuih Liêm. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ơi dhơ bâân rathaai tââq dyóp rau, aku ơi đóng ađêi kala têêng dhơn ratơơq đóng dyóp ngaai, buôn aku ve chóóm đuôh praaq bơk ngaai lơh. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Nek palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq, aku val xar kơi manưih Jo Thaaiq, buôn aku ve chóóm đuôh praaq manưih Jo Thaaiq. Nek palơq nôôq ngaai tơơt raal gani, aku val xar kơi tơơt raal gani, dhơ aku kala kah tơơt raal gani, buôn aku ve chóóm đuôh praaq nôôq ngaai tơơt raal gani. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Nek palơq nôôq manưih kah ve gani, aku val xar kơi manưih kah ve gani (dhơ eh rau nek kah ve gani ưng Yaang Pleng, bơơi nek tơơt raal gani ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih), buôn aku ve chóóm đuôh praaq nôôq manưih kah ve gani. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Nek palơq nôôq manưih dhur lóóm, aku val xar kơi dhur lóóm, buôn aku ve chóóm đuôh praaq nôôq manưih dhur lóóm. Aku ơi val xar dyóp kơi nek palơq dyóp ngaai, hơq đóng aku ve chóóm palơq dyóp kơi bâân paq masôôq manưih. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Mat lââng, aku têêng dyóp tarnêêng ơi taai Taruuih Liêm, buôn aku ve chóóm val xar manưih pâng phơn kalóóng ađek. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Adhi anó kah n'nal kơi tabhơt nôôq manưih mut kalóóng pajươi mut maar mut, bơơi chapiên mưi chanak đơơp kaliim haanh alua? Phaai mut ting kơi ađek buôn adhi anó ve chóóm jươi bâân kaliim haanh. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Mat lââng, dyóp ngaai tarjeng pajươi kalóóng nôôq ganơt pađươk nek pakeen pakala achak kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng. Dhơ piđó đơơp kơi achêk buôn piđó ve chóóm đơơp panơơng pơơng đâh hư jir, bơơi nôôq he nek panơơng pơơng yươq hư jir. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Kơi achêk hayơq, aku mut kơi achêk, eh rau kơi kah ve machak maraang; aku tachuh tatơm kơi achêk, eh rau kơi chuh adhiiq. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Palâh lóóiq, aku pa-eep achak araang ađêi lơq phaai xâng ađó, e vaaih palơq kơi kiq ađek, xong xók truuih pachóóm bơk manưih lââng, chênh ađêi kala ve nh'jau bâân talơơi.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ơi nhan móón adhi anó, aku kah kiêng adhi anó kah n'nal kơi abhươp avuôq nôôq he pabhơt ơi tơơt raraal garboq dhaluk, pabhơt ơi chaang lơh taxiiq. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Pabhơt malóóm ting Môôi-se ơi bâân têêng bap-teem kalóóng garboq dhaluk lơq raal taxiiq, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />pabhơt ơi cha palơq mưi rau tarmông huuiq Chuôq, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />lơq pabhơt ơi ơm palơq mưi đơơk ơm huuiq Chuôq, ơi piđó ơm tââq mưi bhangôh dhơl huuiq Chuôq ting ađêi, hơq dhơl ađek nek Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Pleng ơi kah liêm lóóm palơq bơk ngaai nôôq manưih achêk, hayơq piđó bâân kalơm chêt dhiq ađô dhiq tôh kalóóng kruung vơng. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Mat lââng, nôôq rau ađô ơi val xar nôôq đuui lóóiq đóng nôôq he, buôn óóq têêng nôôq he nek nôôq manưih malóóch kiêng nôôq rau môôp lơt kung thê kơi piđó ơi malóóch kiêng. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kung óóq val xar nôôq manưih bhuôih kabhêi kơi nôôq manưih tôôh kalóóng nôôq piđó; tơk mơ kơi ve paraaq xaraq: “Dhanuôr manưih tơơt chok leq buôn cha lơq ơm, hơq yuur dyương blôônh vavơq.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Nôôq he kung kah chóóm têêng matu tapiing taniêt kơi bơk ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó ơi têêng taniêt, hơq bơơr jêt pe ngaan manưih ơi kalơm chêt kalóóng mưi tangêi. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Kung kah chóóm klêêu Chuôq kơi bơk ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó ơi klêêu Chuôq hayơq bâân leng chêt tââq kaxênh. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Kung óóq m'bhoonh kơi bơk ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó ơi m'bhoonh lơq bâân yaang kaxiêt leng chêt. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq tarnêêng achêk ơi yuur vaaih đóng piđó kơi nôôq đuui lóóiq, hơq piđó ơi bâân xaraq lóóiq đóng leq tarnêêng praaq pachóóm nôôq he, nek dhiq nôôq manưih hơq nôôq rau tatun xariêq ưng nôôq klaang đơơi ơi tơk aq. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Ơi kơi achêk, ngaai ngóq ađêi dyương, phaai chagơn vaaih kalơm. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Kah rau dharơơl galơơk n'đó ve tơk palơq adhi anó chapiên rau mađó leq akóón manưih; mat lââng, Yaang Pleng yươq tadhơ, nek Yaang e kah lơơi adhi anó bâân dharơơl galơơk lơh mơ praan adhi anó đuôh jruôn, bơơi palơq rau dharơơl galơơk ađek, Ađó kung e lóng kalơng gluh buôn adhi anó ve chóóm đuôh đơơp jruôn.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Taai kơi achêk, adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku ơơi, phaai viêr changaai tââq rau bhuôih kabhêi. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Kơi ngóq aku xók praaq kayua palơq nôôq manưih tabech n'nal. Adhi anó phaai tư kanóq chamet rau aku praaq. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Choom phươk liêm hơq nôôq he nhan ma-ơơn, kah alua ađek nek rau tapâng phơn kalóóng ahaam ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih alua? Beng hơq nôôq he yuur veh, kah alua ađek nek rau tapâng phơn kalóóng achak ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih alua? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Taai ve mưi beq beng, hayơq nôôq he, dhơ bơk, chapiên nek mưi achak, taai tabhơt nôôq he tapâng phơn kalóóng mưi beq beng. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Phaai lêi dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ting phơn achak. Kah alua nôôq ngaai cha adhah bhuôih nek nôôq manưih tapâng phơn dhiq baang bhanuôih alua? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Kơi achêk, aku xók praaq hau rau? Bhanuôih bhuôih kabhêi nek hau rau-riq? Môôiq kabhêi nek hau-hiq? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Dhơ kơi achêk, nôôq rau hơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk nguôi bhuôih bhưk nek bhuôih bhưk đóng abhưi abhóch, eh rau đóng Yaang Pleng. Hơq aku kah kiêng adhi anó val xar nôôq manưih tapâng phơn palơq nôôq abhưi! <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Adhi anó kah chóóm mơ ơm choom ưng Chuôq lơq choom ưng abhưi abhóch chóóm. Adhi anó kah chóóm mơ tapâng phơn dhiq baang ưng Chuôq lơq dhiq baang ưng abhưi abhóch chóóm. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Môôiq nôôq he pacha lóóm đóng Chuôq yuur pagrâ kơq? Ve kơq nôôq he nek karơ lơh Chuôq?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Dyóp rau nek chóóm pheep,” bơơi eh rau dyóp rau đââng tơk malơơi. “Dyóp rau nek chóóm pheep,” bơơi eh rau dyóp rau đââng têêng tahayuur. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Óóq ngaai achêk tabâân malơơi n'tua ưng ađêi, bơơi nek malơơi ưng manưih lââng. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Phaai cha dyóp rau bâân kơl baan dhiq chơơq, óóq tamóh rau ơi taai lóóm karnóq. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Ơi “katiêk palơq dyóp rau kalóóng ađó mađó leq Chuôq.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />La dhơ dhangaai manưih kah ơi huuiq kayua adhi anó lơq adhi anó kiêng vôôiq, nek phaai cha dyóp jama jamat bâân dhoon toom mat ađêi, óóq tamóh hau rau ơi taai lóóm karnóq. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Bơơi la ngaai ađek móón palơq adhi anó: “Ađô nek bhanuôih bhuôih,” nek óóq cha, ơi taai manưih ađek, nek manưih ơi đóng adhi anó n'nal, lơq lóóm karnóq. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Bơơi aku praaq leq lóóm karnóq, eh rau nek ưng kala achak adhi anó, hơq nek lóóm karnóq ưng manưih ađek. Achêk nek hau kơi rau rathaai ưng aku bâân lóóm karnóq ưng manưih lââng xêi lơt? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />La aku ting tơơt palơq lóóm n'nal ơơn, nek ng'kơi aku bâân praaq tamôôp taai dhanah hơq aku ma-ơơn? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Taai ađek, dhơ dhakơi adhi anó cha, môôiq ơm, hamôôiq têêng mưi n'đó tarnêêng ađek, phaai têêng tabhơt đóng rau cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Óóq têêng palââng ting lơt đóng miq manưih Jo Thaaiq, palơq manưih Hi-laap, lơq kabhuh akóón dhơn ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Thê kơi aku kung ravang lóóm têêng yaauq dyóp ngaai kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng, Kah tabâân malơơi ưng n'tua ađêi, bơơi nek malơơi ưng bơk ngaai, buôn piđó ve chóóm bâân paq.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Phaai val xar nôôq manưih ting đuui aku, kơi aku kung nek manưih ting đuui Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Aku haanh adhi anó taai adhi anó ơi hei tơk aku kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng, lơq adhi anó jư tamưng nôôq taruuih hanua, dhiêp kơi aku ơi truuih đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Dhơ kơi ađek, aku kiêng adhi anó n'nal kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih nek akoq ưng dyóp ngaai manưih padruuih, hơq manưih padruuih nek akoq ưng manưih pađiil, hayơq Yaang Pleng nek akoq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Dyóp ngaai manưih padruuih gavơh nhan môôiq loom truuih taruuih Yaang Pleng, la ve rauriq ađek klum dhiq akoq, nek têêng tamôôp akoq ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Bơơi dyóp ngaai manưih pađiil gavơh nhan môôiq loom truuih taruuih Yaang Pleng palơq akoq kah bâân klum lóóiq, nek tamôôp akoq ađêi. Taai rau ađô nek mưi palơq tarnêêng akoq ơi goot kaklông. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ơi la mưi manưih pađiil kah klum akoq, nek pađiil achêk kung phaai kut xok vaq. Hayơq la kut xok hamôôiq goot akoq nek rau tamôôp nek palơq manưih pađiil, nek pađiil ađek phaai klum akoq lóóiq. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Ơi mưi mat, manưih padruuih kah chóóm klum akoq ađêi taai đââng a-ô lơq cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng. Mat lââng, manưih pađiil nek cha-iil tabah ưng manưih padruuih. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Taai manưih padruuih nek kah gluh tââq manưih pađiil, hơq nek manưih pađiil gluh tââq manưih padruuih. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Kung taai manưih padruuih kah bâân tavaaih taai manưih pađiil, hơq nek manưih pađiil taai manưih padruuih. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Taai ơi kơi achêk, manưih pađiil kơng phaai pơơng karnal karơ kataai dhiq akoq ađêi, ơi taai nôôq dhơn pleng. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Dhơ kơi achêk, kalóóng Chuôq, manưih pađiil kah pantua palơq manưih padruuih, manưih padruuih kung kah pantua palơq manưih pađiil. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Taai manưih pađiil gluh tââq manưih padruuih n'đó kơi, nek manưih padruuih kung đươi manưih pađiil hơq ve kơi achêk. Bơơi dyóp rau gluh tââq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Phaai chamet lêi dhiq m'pơng chênh ađêi adhi anó: Manưih pađiil kah klum akoq gavơh nhan palơq Yaang Pleng nek ve pâng kah? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Kah alua dhalam chênh kơi kaxu pachóóm adhi anó kơi mưi mat, la manưih padruuih lơơi xok yaal, hơq ađek nek yuur takađiq kachiit đóng ađó? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Mat lââng, la manưih pađiil ve bhayam xok yaal, hơq ađek nek cha-iil tabah đóng leq pađiil achêk alua? Taai bhayam xok yaal ơi bâân đóng leq pađiil achêk babi kơi kalum klum akoq. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Hayơq la ngaai đơơp ngóq ve lóóm tarliin tarkaai leq tarnêêng ađô, nek nôôq yi kah ve pakeen đu kơi achêk, nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng kung kah.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Bơơi xók đââng pagluh pachóóm râng tatun ađô, aku kah haanh adhi anó, taai adhi anó karong nhoom palơq xóng ađêi kah ruul tơk rau liêm lơh, bơơi nek malóóm tơk dhiq môôp lơh. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Bơơi laloom bhơt, xók adhi anó nhoom lóóiq kalóóng kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq, aku xâng leq bơk rau tablah dhiq m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó, lơq aku huuiq rau ađek maphơn giêl. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Taai kơng phaai ve nôôq malóóm mahóng m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó, hơq đóng nôôq ngaai ơi đơơp klêêu klôôq kung ve chóóm bâân gluh pakah drêh-dróói m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Taai kơi achêk, xók adhi anó nhoom lóóiq dhiq mađó madhiq, tarnêêng achêk eh rau nek buôn tơơt Bhiêk Liêm ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Taai xók bhêêl cha, ting chanak tarhươk cha vaar cha mưi ađêi loom, hayơq dhơ ve ngaai nek ha-ul li-veu, bơơi ve ngaai nek ból plơ. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ve kơq adhi anó kah ve đong buôn cha lơq ơm kalóóng ađek alua? Môôiq adhi anó kađiq Kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng lơq têêng bil mat nôôq manưih kah ve rau? Aku hayơq praaq harau palơq adhi anó? Hayơq bhi haanh adhi anó leq tarnêêng ađô kơq? Aku kah haanh adhi anó mơ! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Taai aku ơi đơơp tââq Chuôq rau aku kung ơi truuih lóóiq đóng adhi anó, ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su, xók hayum hơq Ađó bâân tamôôp pajaau, ơi pei beng, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />hayơq xong xók ma-ơơn, Ađó yuur veh beng lơq praaq: “Ađô nek achak araang ưng thêi klóóih đóng adhi anó; phaai têêng rau ađô kalóóng rau kanóq hei tơk leq thêi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Kung makơi ađek nek palơq choom xong xók cha, kơi ađô: “Choom ađô nek raket bóóp tame kalóóng ahaam thêi. La xók bhêêl adhi anó ơm choom, phaai têêng rau ađô kalóóng rau kanóq hei leq thêi.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Ơi la xók bhêêl adhi anó cha beng ađô lơq ơm choom ađô, adhi anó truuih đuui rau chêt ưng Chuôq đóng tơk xók Ađó bhral. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Đóng hayơq, dhơ mak ngaai cha beng hamôôiq ơm choom ưng chuôq mưi kơi kah đaang dhalam nek e ve matu palơq achak lơq ahaam ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Palâh lóóiq, ting chanak phaai tư lêi ađêi, hayơq kalóóng lóóm kanóq ađek hơq cha beng lơq ơm choom. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ơi ngaai cha lơq ơm hơq kah n'nal pantua achak Chuôq nek cha lơq ơm rau xêi lơt đóng ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Taai ơi kơi ađek, bơk ngaai kalóóng adhi anó ka-ai pakhau, dhuôr xar lơq bơk manưih bêch. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Bơơi la nôôq he tư kanóq lêi ađêi, nek dhakơi nôôq he yươq bâân xêi lơt. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Hayơq xók bâân Chuôq xêi lơt, nôôq he bâân taklôôq paliêm buôn yươq bâân tabóq matu madhiq palơq manưih hóng katiêk. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kơi achêk hayơq, adhi anó ưng aku ơơi, xók karong lóóiq buôn cha, phaai tarđương xóng ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />La ngaai manưih ha-ul, nek phaai cha dhiq đong, buôn adhi anó óóq karong nhoom dhiq kalóóng rau xêi lơt. Hayơq leq nôôq tarnêêng lââng, aku e pakah paraaq chaleq kađââng dhalam bhêêl xók aku bhral.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Hayơq leq nôôq ơơn đuui Chuôq, nhan móón adhi anó, aku kah kiêng adhi anó kah n'nal rauriq. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Adhi anó n'nal kơi xók ađêi dyơq nek manưih ti, adhi anó ơi bâân kađââng chơơng ting kơi kiq ađek, xók bâân kajôông kamôôi malóóm leq nôôq kabhêi bơq. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Taai kơi achêk, aku pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal kơi kah ngaai papraaq tââq Yaang Liêm ưng Yaang Pleng hơq vil móón: “Jê-su nek manưih đaang tóh!” Lơq la kah tââq Chuôq Yaang Liêm, kah ngaai ve chóóm đơơp móón “Chuôq Jê-su nek Chuôq.”<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Mat lââng, ve bơk rau n'tua kơi leq nôôq ơơn liêm, bơơi mađó mưi Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ve bơk rau n'tua kơi leq nôôq tarnêêng têêng yaauq, hơq mađó mưi Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ve bơk rau n'tua lalêi leq nôôq tarnêêng, hơq mađó mưi Yaang Pleng, nek Yaang têêng dyóp tarnêêng kalóóng dyóp ngaai. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Bơơi rau têêng pakah ưng Yaang Liêm bâân pajaau đóng ting chanak buôn đââng lóóiq malơơi madhiq. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ơi đươi Yaang Liêm, paraaq tarbech galang bâân đóng leq manưih ađô, hayơq paraaq tarbech bâân đóng leq manưih lââng ting mađó mưi Yaang Liêm achêk; <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />tââq mađó mưi Yaang Liêm lóóm huuiq bâân đóng leq manưih ađô, hayơq ơơn payươh ka-ai bâân đóng leq manưih lââng tââq mưi Yaang Liêm achêk, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Hayơq đóng manưih ađô, nôôq rau tarnêêng mataai karơ; đóng manưih tôôh, paraaq loom truuih taruuih; đóng manưih têêh, đuôh chóóm n'nal nôôq yaang; đóng manưih lââng, nôôq kơi rau dhariêng n'tua kơi; hơq đóng manưih lââng dyơq, rau chóóm lók nôôq dhariêng paraaq. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Bơơi chapiên mưi giêl lơq mađó mưi Yaang Liêm yuur têêng dyóp tarnêêng achêk, xók blah nh'xóóng piđó kơi n'tua rau đóng ting chanak manưih ting kơi karnóq Ađó kiêng.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ơi thê kơi achak nek mưi hơq ve bơk rau dhiq achak, hayơq tabhơt nôôq rau dhiq ưng achak, dhơ ve bơk, hơq chapiên nek mưi achak, Chuôq Paq Manưih kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Ơi alua tââq mưi Yaang Liêm, tabhơt nôôq he bâân têêng bap-teem mót kalóóng mưi achak, dhơ nek manưih Jo Thaaiq môôiq manưih Hi-laap, dhơ nek têêng xól môôiq manưih rathaai, nek tabhơt bâân têêng đóng ơm mưi Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ơi achak nek eh rau mưi beq dhiq achak, bơơi nek bơk rau dhiq achak. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Pajra móón dyung praaq: “Taai aku eh rau nek têi, hayơq aku eh mađó leq achak,” nek kah chóóm taai kơi achêk hơq ađó kah mađó leq achak. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Lơq pajra kơi katór praaq: “Taai aku eh rau nek mat, hayơq aku kah mađó leq achak,” nek kah chóóm ơi taai achêk hơq ađó kah mađó leq achak. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />La bhơt achak nek kaliêng mat, nek tarnêêng xâng n'đó dhiq? La bhơt achak nek bóng katór, nek tarnêêng hunh n'đó dhiq? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Kơi achêk hayơq, palâh lóóiq, Yaang Pleng ơi ralap rapaq nôôq rau phơn kalóóng achak, ting beq mưi kalóóng nôôq piđó, ting kơi karnóq Ađó kiêng. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Hayơq la tabhơt biêh nek mưi rau dhiq achak, nek achak tơơt n'dhiq? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Hơq kơi achêk, dhơ bơk rau dhiq achak, bơơi chapiên mưi achak. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Mat lââng, mat kah ve chóóm praaq palơq têi: “Aku kah ve rau đươi leq amei.” Môôiq akoq kung kơi achêk nek palơq dyung: “Aku kah ve rau đươi leq amei.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Palâh lóóiq, nôôq rau dhiq kalóóng achak đơơp ngóq kơi nek dhur óóch lơh hơq nek kơng bhlơng dhaang lơh. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />N'đó phơn kalóóng achak hơq nôôq he lêi đơơp ngóq nek kah rauriq lơh nek nôôq he koom đóng ađó rau bhi chap gamak lơh; lơq nôôq rau dhiq achak kah liêm ưng nôôq he nek ve rau pacham paliêm bơk lơh, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />hayơq nôôq phơn dhiq achak ơi liêm ưng nôôq he, nek kah ve đươi tơk achêk. Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Pleng ơi m'bhô achak araang palơq xóng piđó, đóng kơơq rau bhi chap đóng n'đó beq m'bưưiq bâân bhi chap, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />hơq đóng óóq ve rau tablah tachia kalóóng achak, bơơi hơq nôôq phơn dhiq achak kung lêi kanóq tơk xóng ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Xók mưi phơn dhiq achak pâng ka-ai, nek tabhơt nôôq phơn dhiq achak kung jruôn; la mưi phơn dhiq achak bâân bhi chap, nek dyóp phơn dhiq achak bhuui madhiq palơq ađó. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Mat lââng, adhi anó nek achak araang ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, lơq nek nôôq dhiq achak ưng ting phơn lalêi n'tua. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Yaang Pleng ơi chaleq đóng mưi phơn manưih kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq. Laloom tââm nek sưưq-đô, hơq bơơr nek nôôq manưih đââng taruuih Yaang Pleng, đu pe nek nôôq manưih pachóóm, hayơq tơk nôôq mataai chrih, xong ađek nek nôôq ơơn payươh ka-ai, poor jóói, têêng kala, lơq nôôq bơk rau dhariêng n'tua kơi. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Ve kơq pabhơt nek sưưq-đô? Ve kơq pabhơt nek manưih đââng taruuih? Ve kơq pabhơt nek manưih pachóóm? Ve kơq pabhơt maar têêng mataai chrih? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Ve kơq pabhơt ve ơơn payươh ka-ai? Ve kơq pabhơt praaq dhariêng chrih? Ve kơq pabhơt chóóm kluôh lók? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Bơơi phaai bhơt lóóm rââm kiêng nôôq ơơn bhươh gamak lơh. Hayơq dhalam xók ađôk, aku chapiên đóng adhi anó lêi mưi ploong kalơng liêm kre lơh.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Dhơ aku ve chóóm praaq bơk nôôq dhariêng ưng akóón manưih lơq dhơn Pleng, hơq aku kah ve lóóm tanhơr, nek aku ơi val kơi m'beq dhariêng góóng tar-auq môôiq bheeng kabhór ka-uôih kadhuôih. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Dhơ aku ve ơơn truuih taruuih Chuôq lơq ve chóóm n'nal tabhơt đu lalââp palơq dyóp tarbech, lơq dhơ aku ve pabhơt lóóm huuiq patơk mơ patââi bôôl booiq, hơq aku kah ve lóóm tanhơr nek aku kah rauriq. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Patơk mơ dhơ xók aku pei đóng dyóp drươp karvaan ưng ađêi, lơq dhơ aku pajaau achak ađêi hơq đóng aku ve chóóm yuur pajơơr, hơq aku kah ve lóóm tanhơr nek aku kah bâân rau ve. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Lóóm tanhơr ve lóóm đơơp jruôn lơq pakah rau moor dha-iiq. Lóóm tanhơr yươq makhinh; Lóóm tanhơr yươq laach jơơr, yươq praaq parlaach, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />yươq têêng praaq grô próng, kah tabâân mââl nhan nôôq rau ưng n'tua ađêi, yươq buôn bâân ơơr pagrâ, yươq kanóq lóóm rau lơt aak, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />yươq bhuui leq rau kah dhalam, bơơi bhuui sương kalóóng paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Lóóm tanhơr lơơi bhơt dyóp rau, huuiq ganơơm dyóp rau, đương rââm dyóp rau, đơơp jruôn dyóp rau. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Lóóm tanhơr yươq mơ chóóm luui bil. Mat lââng, dhơ nek ơơn praaq paraaq Yaang pleng, nek piđó bhơt hatươt, dhơ nek ơơn praaq bơk rau dhariêng, nek piđó e kadhơq; dhơ nek tarbech bhriêl galang, nek piđó e bâân m'peq lơơi. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Taai nôôq he đuui n'nal phơn m'bưưiq, lơq nôôq he truuih taruuih Yaang Pleng phơn m'bưưiq. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Bơơi xók rau bing dyóp tơk, rau kah ơi dyóp ưng phơn achêk e bâân m'peq lơơi. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Xók aku dyơq nek akóón paniên, aku praaq kơi akóón paniên, aku kanóq kơi akóón paniên, aku tar-ââi kơi akóón paniên. Xók aku val kơi taha, aku m'peq lơơi nôôq tarnêêng ưng akóón paniên. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Ơi, bhêêl ađôk, nôôq he móng lêi dhiq xamil palơq a-ô li-bhrơơu, bơơi tơk bhêêl ađek nek mat taje mat. Xók ađôk, aku ve bâân n'nal phơn m'bưưiq, bơơi tơk bhêêl ađek, aku e bâân n'nal bing dyóp, kung kơi aku ơi bâân n'nal kơi bing dyóp. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Bơơi xók ađôk dyơq lóóiq pe rau ađô: Lóóm huuiq, lóóm rââm, lơq lóóm tanhơr; hơq rau liêm lơh pabhơt kalóóng pe rau achêk nek lóóm tanhơr.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Phaai ting taviêng lóóm tanhơr, bơơi phaai jêi tarang leq nôôq ơơn liêm đuui chuôq, hơq tââm nek buôn adhi anó ve chóóm praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Taai manưih praaq paraaq chrih nek kah praaq palơq akóón manưih, bơơi nek palơq Yaang Pleng, taai kah ngaai n'nal, dhơ kơi achêk, ađó praaq nôôq rau đu lalââp kalóóng lóóm karnóq. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Bơơi manưih praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng nek yuur praaq rau têêng tahayuur, lơq pahêêl palơq rau paraaq bhơơl đóng leq palââng. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Manưih praaq dhariêng chrih nek têêng tahayuur ađêi kala, hayơq manưih praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng nek têêng tahayuur akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Mat lââng aku rââm lêi tabhơt adhi anó praaq dhariêng chrih, hơq hayơq lơh kơi achêk dyơq, ađek nek adhi anó ve chóóm praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng. Bơơi manưih praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng liêm pabhlơng lơh manưih praaq dhariêng chrih chapiên ngaai ađek ve chóóm kluôh lók, hơq đóng akóón dhơn Chuôq bâân đơơp rau têêng tahayuur. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Bơơi, nhan móón adhi anó, pajra kơi xók ađôk aku tơk praaq nôôq rau dhariêng chrih palơq adhi anó, nek aku e poor harau malơơi đóng adhi anó la aku kah praaq palơq adhi anó kalóóng rau pakah đóng lêi, môôiq tarbech galang bheh bhriêl, hamôôiq palơq paraaq taruuih Yaang Pleng môôiq paraaq pató pachóóm? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Patơk mơ nôôq rau kah n'nal rarau yuur vaaih dhariêng, dhơ nek n'dreh aluôt môôiq tambhreh haak, la ting rau kah yuur tavaaih nôôq dhariêng xanuul n'tua lalêi, nek dhariêng bâân plong dhiq aluôt hamôôiq dhariêng bâân peh dhiq tambhreh haak e bâân đơơp n'nal palơq n'đó kơi? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ơi la karyóól yuur vaaih xanuul kah drêh dróói nek ngaai e ravang lơơi đóng ganhuh tarjơl? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Adhi anó kung thê kơi achêk: La tapâng dhiq bóóp n'taak ađêi, adhi anó kah praaq pakah paraaq praaq drêh dróói khe n'nal, nek ng'kơi têêng rau bâân gluh paraaq e ve chóóm bâân n'nal? Taai adhi anó chapiên nek xók papraaq chiên palơq adhiiq. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ve nôôq rau paraaq dhariêng n'tua kơi dhiq hóng katiêk, dhakơi ve n'jau nek bơk bhlơng, lơq kah ve n'đó nek kah malơơi. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Kơi achêk, la aku kah n'nal kiêng móón ưng dhariêng paraaq, hơq aku e nek manưih katiêk lââng nek palơq manưih xók papraaq, lơq manưih xók papraaq achêk e nek manưih katiêk lââng nek palơq aku. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Adhi anó kung thê kơi achêk. Taai adhi anó nek nôôq manưih jêi tarang kalóóng nôôq ơơn liêm đuui Chuôq malóóm tơk tarnêêng têêng tahayuur akóón dhơn Chuôq, hayơq phaai chik-chêk hơq đóng adhi anó ve xưa raai. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Ơi kơi achêk, manưih praaq dhariêng chrih phaai gavơh nhan buôn ngaai ađek ve chóóm lók kluôh. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />La aku gavơh nhan palơq dhariêng chrih, nek lóóm yaang ưng aku gavơh nhan, bơơi lóóm karnóq aku nek kah rau mayưưm. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Kơi achêk nek ng'kơi ađôk? Aku e gavơh nhan palơq lóóm yaang, bơơi kung e gavơh nhan palơq lóóm karnóq. Aku e babóóch palơq lóóm yaang, bơơi kung e babóóch palơq lóóm karnóq. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />La kah, la adhi anó babóóch chachơp palơq lóóm yaang, nek n'đó kơi têêng manưih dyương dhiq dham ưng manưih kaxu e praaq “A-meen” nek palơq paraaq ma-ơơn ưng adhi anó, taai manưih achêk kah n'nal adhi anó xók praaq harau? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ơi dhơ kơi adhi anó tapôông paraaq ma-ơơn kơi liêm kre, bơơi manưih lââng kah bâân têêng tahayuur. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Aku ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng kơi aku praaq bơk dhariêng chrih lơh tabhơt adhi anó, <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />bơơi kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq, n'jang aku praaq xââng paleh palơq lóóm karnóq ađêi buôn aku kung ve chóóm pató pachóóm nôôq manưih lââng, lơh nek kaaq bhaan paleh palơq dhariêng chrih.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Adhi anó ơơi, óóq val kơi akóón paniên kalóóng lóóm kanóq ưng ađêi. Palâh lóóiq, phaai kơi akóón paniên nek palơq rau aak, bơơi phaai val kơi manưih taha kalóóng lóóm kanóq. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Kalóóng gani ve paraaq xaraq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">“Chuôq praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Aku e praaq palơq dhanuôr ađô</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">tââq nôôq manưih praaq nôôq rau dhariêng lââng lơq palơq bưưr bóóp ưng nôôq manưih changaai chrih;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">hơq patơk mơ kơi achêk, piđó kung e kah xâng Aku.’”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Chênh taai kơi achêk, nôôq dhariêng chrih buôn têêng mưi karnal, eh rau đóng manưih huuiq, hơq nek đóng manưih kah ơi huuiq; hayơq praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng nek eh rau đóng manưih kah ơi huuiq, hơq nek đóng manưih huuiq. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Kơi achêk nek, pajra kơi bhơt akóón dhơn Chuôq nhoom lóóiq dhiq mađó mưi dhiq lơq pabhơt praaq dhariêng chrih, hơq manưih kaxu môôiq manưih kah ơi huuiq tơk tơơt, nek eh alua piđó e móón kơi adhi anó xươl abhôh kah alua? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Bơơi la pabhơt praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng, hơq masôôq manưih kah ơi huuiq môôiq manưih kaxu tơk tơơt, nek manưih ađek e bâân dyóp ngaai trêh móón lơq bâân dyóp ngaai praaq tamóh, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />nôôq rau kadrêi lââp kalóóng lóóm manưih achêk bâân tapakah drêh dróói, lơq taai kơi achêk, xók ơi chip mat chok leq, manưih achêk e bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng, praaq karơ kơi “Yaang Pleng lalua tơơt dhiq m'pơng adhi anó.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Kơi achêk, nhan móón adhi anó, pajoop lóóiq nek harau? Xók adhi anó karong nhoom lóóiq, ting chanak ve haanh pleng, ve paraaq pató pachóóm, ve rau tapakah, ve dhariêng chrih, môôiq ve rau kluôh lók. Phaai lơơi dyóp rau yuur vaaih malóóm tơk tarnêêng têêng tahayuur. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Alua kơq ngaai ađek praaq dhariêng chrih, nek mưi chu bơơr môôiq bhơt bơk nek pe chanak, ting matââq tââq, lơq mưi chanak phaai lók kluôh. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Hayơq la kah ve ngaai lók kluôh, nek manưih ađek phaai parngau kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq, klóóih leq ađek, phaai praaq palơq chênh ađêi lơq palơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Hayơq nôôq manưih bâân ơơn praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng, phaai lơơi bơơr môôiq pe chanak yuur papraaq, lơq nôôq manưih lââng phaai chamet xâng. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Bơơi la ve rauriq bâân tapakah đóng mưi ngaai ađek đu lââng xók tơơt nhoom, nek manưih đu laloom phaai parngau dhariêng. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ơi tabhơt ve chóóm praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng ting chanak mưi, buôn dyóp ngaai ve chóóm đuui n'nal lơq dyóp ngaai bâân tabhơơl. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Lóóm yaang ưng nôôq manưih praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng đơơp xâng nôôq manưih praaq taruuih Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ơi Yaang Pleng eh rau nek ưng rau nhôôn nhaauq, hơq nek ưng rau khe liêm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kơi tabhơt kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng nôôq manưih huuiq, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />manưih pađiil phaai tơơt parngau kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq. Taai piđó kah chóóm pheep papraaq, hơq phaai xâng bóóp, kung kơi gani pachóóm. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Bơơi la piđó kiêng đuui n'nal ve rau, nek piđó phaai tamóh kayiik ưng ađêi dhiq đong, taai alua nek đaang kachiit mat kơi palơq pađiil pađââr dhariêng dhiq m'pơng akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Môôiq paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng yuur gluh tââq adhi anó alua? Môôiq paraaq Chuôq chapiên tơk palơq adhi anó hơq giêl?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />La ngaai manưih đóng kơi ađêi nek manưih truuih taruuih Yaang Pleng môôiq manưih đuui Chuôq, nek manưih achêk phaai đơơp n'nal kơi nôôq rau aku xaraq đóng adhi anó nek paraaq râng ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Bơơi la ngaai manưih kah đơơp lêi n'nal kơi achêk, nek phaai lơơi manưih ađek kah bâân lêi n'nal.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Chênh taai kơi achêk, nhan móón adhi anó, phaai kiêng rahaal praaq truuih taruuih Chuôq lơq óóq châq praaq dhariêng chrih. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Bơơi phaai yuur têêng dyóp tarnêêng kơi kre dhalam lơq kalóóng matư ma-iiq.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Nhan móón adhi anó, aku pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal leq Taruuih Liêm hơq aku ơi truuih móón đóng adhi anó, nek rau hơq adhi anó kung ơi đơơp xâng, lơq dyương tamưng dhiq ađek, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />kung tââq Taruuih Liêm achêk, hơq adhi anó bâân paq, la adhi anó pei dyuôch tamưng taruuih hơq aku ơi truuih pachóóm đóng adhi anó, la kah alua kơi achêk, nek adhi anó ơi huuiq kơi kah malơơi malaai. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Taai kalóóng nôôq rau laloom tââm aku ơi truuih đóng adhi anó, nek rau hơq aku kung ơi đơơp huuiq, ađek nek Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi chêt taai matu lơt ưng nôôq he ting paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Ađó ơi bâân tơp, lơq ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq leq tangêi đu pe ting paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Lơq Ađó ơi pakah đóng Sê-pha, hayơq đóng majêt bơơr sưưq-đô. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Tââq ađek, Ađó ơi pakah ađêi đóng lơh xââng hariêng adhi anó bâân lêi palơq mandrươh, pabhơt bơk ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó ađôk bhiêk dyơq mamông, bơơi maphơn ơi xir. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Xong ađek, Ađó ơi tabhral đóng Ja-kơ, hayơq đóng tabhơt nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Kơi achêk hayơq, đóng patơk xariêq paluch ưng dyóp ngaai, Ađó kung ơi pakah ađêi đóng aku bâân lêi, pakơi đóng mưi panong paniên n'niên nhuum. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Taai aku nek manưih katưưiq tââm kalóóng nôôq sưưq-đô, nek manưih kah ve chóóm đaang rau đóng bâân đóók nek sưưq-đô, taai aku ơi kóóp janah akóón dhơn Chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Bơơi tââq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng hơq aku nek chênh ađêi xók ađôk, lơq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Ađó kalóóng aku eh rau nek kah malơơi. Klóóih leq ađek, aku ơi nhok jarnah bơk xưa lơh tabhơt nôôq piđó ađek, bơơi eh rau aku, hơq nek ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt palơq aku. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Kơi achêk, dhơ nek aku môôiq nek nôôq piđó achêk, nek nôôq yi truuih pachóóm kơi achêk lơq adhi anó ơi huuiq kơi achêk.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Dhơ kơi ađek, la Chuôq Paq Manưih bâân truuih pachóóm kơi Ađó ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, nek ng'kơi têêng mưi phơn manưih kalóóng adhi anó móón kơi kah ve rau mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Bơơi la kah ve rau mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt, hơq chênh nek Chuôq Paq Manưih kung ơi kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />hơq la Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, nek rau truuih pachóóm ưng nôôq yi nek kah malơơi, lơq lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó kung kah rau akiiq liêm. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Hayơq nôôq yi patơk mơ bâân lêi nek nôôq manưih praaq truuih chachââr ưng Yaang Pleng, tââq nôôq yi ơi praaq truuih leq Yaang Pleng kơi Ađó ơi têêng Chuôq Paq Manưih mamông lóóiq, kơi achêk hayơq pajra kơi manưih chêt kah bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq, nek Ađó ơi kah têêng Yaang achêk mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Ơi la manưih chêt kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, hơq chênh nek Chuôq Paq Manưih kung ơi kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />lơq la Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, nek lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó nek kah malơơi; adhi anó bhiêk dyơq tơơt kalóóng matu lơt ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Kơi achêk hayơq nôôq manưih ơi xir kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih kung bâân chêt bil. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />La kalóóng nôôq he ve lóóm rââm dhiq Chuôq Paq Manưih chapiên kalóóng parmông ađôk, hơq nôôq he nek nôôq manưih đaang kayô lơh bhơt kalóóng tabhơt dyóp ngaai.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Bơơi xók ađôk, Chuôq Paq Manưih ơi bâân têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, nek pale tanââp nil ưng nôôq manưih ơi xir. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ơi taai tââq mưi chanak hơq ve akan chêt, nek kung tââq mưi chanak hơq ve rau mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ơi n'đó kơi kalóóng A-đaam, dyóp ngaai maar chêt, nek kung kơi achêk, kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih, dyóp ngaai nek bâân têêng đóng mamông. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Bơơi ting chanak ting matââq tââq n'tua ưng ađêi: Chuôq Paq Manưih nek pale tanââp nil; xong tơk nek nôôq manưih mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih xók bhêêl val lóóiq ưng Ađó. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Xong ađek e nek rau tatun xariêq, bhêêl Ađó pajaau katiêk pleng lóóiq leq Yaang Pleng nek Ama, xók Ađó ơi leng pabhơt kala kadhâng akoq, palơq dyóp kala kataai lơq praan karơ. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ơi Yaang achêk phaai kadhâng akoq đóng tơk xók Ađó ơi patơơt pabhơt nôôq manưih aróp brau huông dhiq dyung ađêi. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Manưih brau tatun xariêq bâân leng kaxiêt nek akan chêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Taai “Ađó ơi patơơt dyóp rau raal dyung ađêi.” Bơơi xók praaq kơi.“ Ađó ơi patơơt dyóp rau,” nek drêh dróói nek kah ve pâng Yaang têêng dyóp rau xâng bóóp Ađó. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Xók achêk, xók dyóp rau ơi bâân têêng phaai xâng Ađó, nek bhêêl achêk chênh Akóón kung e xâng bóóp Yaang ơi têêng dyóp rau xâng ađêi, buôn Yaang Pleng ve chóóm nek tabhơt kalóóng dyóp rau.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />La kah lalua kơi achêk, nek nôôq manưih đơơp bap-teem klóóih đóng manưih chêt e têêng harau? La manưih chêt kah lalua bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq, nek hau kơi nôôq manưih achêk đơơp bap-teem klóóih đóng nôôq manưih tôôh? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Hayơq taai hau kơi nôôq yi đơơp tarmenh dyóp bhêêl? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Adhi anó ơơi, aku chêt dyóp tangêi, tââq rau tarhơơnh liêm leq adhi anó, nek rau aku ve kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Chuôq nôôq he. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Pajra la ting kơi ưng akóón manưih, aku ơi tarjơl palơq nôôq adhah grâ dhiq Ê-phê-sô, nek malơơi harau đóng leq aku? La manưih chêt kah bâân têêng mamông lóóiq, nek “phaai cha, lơq ơm, taai tangêi rayiiu nôôq he chêt.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Óóq lơơi bâân galơơk chachââr: “Nôôq manưih marau tarnêêng môôp têêng pahư tabil nôôq lóóm karnóq liêm.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Phaai marngal val lóóiq kơi đaang phaai ve! Lơq óóq dyơq têêng matu lơt. Ơi mưi phơn manưih kah ve n'nal rarau leq Yaang Pleng. Aku praaq rau ađô cha-ól leq aan kachiit mat ưng adhi anó.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Dhơ kơi ađek, mưi chanak tôôh e móón: “Manưih chêt bâân têêng mamông lóóiq palơq n'đó kơi, hơq piđó tơk palơq achak araang ng'kơi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Manưih ngôôk ngaak tôôh ơi! Rau hơq amei đââng choh kah chóóm têêng đóng mamông la ađó kah chêt aq. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Lơq rau amei đââng choh nek eh rau dyaang achak ađó e val xar, palâh lóóiq, amei đââng choh chapiên nek kaliêng m'ma, praaq babi ađó ve nh'jau nek kaliêng haró môôiq kaliêng rau lââng. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng đóng leq ađó mưi dyaang achak ting kơi kanóq Ađó kiêng, lơq đóng ting kaliêng m'ma mưi dyaang achak n'tua. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Kah alua dyóp ng'kar m'bech nek kung mưi ng'kar m'bech. Palâh lóóiq nek ng'kar m'bech n'tua ưng akóón manưih, ng'kar m'bech n'tua ưng nôôq kabhuh adhah, ng'kar m'bech n'tua ưng nôôq kabhuh achim, lơq ng'kar m'bech n'tua ưng nôôq kabhuh kadhóóng. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Kung ve nôôq dyaang achak dhiq pleng lơq nôôq dyaang achak dhiq katiêk. Dhơ kơi ađek cha-iil tabah mađó leq pleng nek kơi ađô, hayơq cha-iil tabah mađó leq katiêk nek kơi tôôh. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Cha-iil tabah ưng mat tangêi nek kơi ađô, cha-iil tabah ưng mat bharương nek kơi tôôh, lơq cha-iil tabah ưng nôôq chatur xamenh nek n'tua dyơq. Taai chatur xamenh ađô n'tua kơi palơq chatur xamenh tôôh leq cha-iil tabah. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Rau mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt kung kơi achêk. Dyaang achak bâân choh katơp kalóóng nek bâân khung nh'xoq, dyaang achak mamông lóóiq kalóóng nek vaaih yươq chóóm chêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Bâân choh katơp kalóóng kadhaap janah, bâân mamông lóóiq kalóóng cha-iil tabah; bâân chok katơp kalóóng dhur óóch, bâân mamông lóóiq kalóóng kataai karơ. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Bâân choh katơp nek dyaang achak kaxu, bâân mamông lóóiq nek dyaang achak cha-iil tabah. La ve dyaang achak kaxu, nek kung ve dyaang achak cha-iil tabah. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Đóng hayơq kung ve paraaq xaraq: “Manưih tarnââp nek A-đaam ơi val xar yaang ravaai mamông.” A-đaam tatun xariêq nek Yaang đóng rau parmông. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Bơơi eh rau dyaang achak cha-iil tabah ve laloom, hơq nek dyaang achak kaxu, xong ađek hayơq tơk dyaang achak cha-iil tabah. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Manưih tarnââp gluh tââq katiêk, nek manưih mađó leq katiêk. Manưih đu bơơr bhral tââq pleng. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Manưih mađó leq katiêk achêk n'đó kơi, nek nôôq manưih mađó leq katiêk kung kơi achêk. Lơq Yaang mađó leq pleng n'đó kơi, nek nôôq manưih mađó leq Pleng kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kơi nôôq he ơi xơp dyaang a-ô ưng manưih mađó leq katiêk, nek nôôq he kung kơng xơp dyaang a-ô ưng Yaang mađó leq pleng.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Mat lââng, nhan móón adhi anó, aku nhan móón rau ađô, kơi achak lơq ahaam kah chóóm bâân đơơp katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. Rau hư bil kung kah bâân đơơp rau kah hư bil. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Lêi nô, aku đóng adhi anó n'nal mưi rau lalââp: Eh rau tabhơt nôôq he e bêch, bơơi tabhơt nôôq he e bâân n'luôt xar, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />kalóóng gamleh mat, kalóóng kabhriêp mat, mót dhariêng karyóól xariêq. Taai karyóól e yuur tar-auq, lơq nôôq manưih chêt e bâân têêng mamông lóóiq kalóóng dyaang achak yươq chêt bil, hayơq nôôq he e bâân n'luôt xar. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Taai pa-eep dyaang achak hư bil ađô pei xơp rau yươq chóóm chêt, lơq dyaang achak phaai chêt ađô pei xơp rau yươq mơ chêt. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Hayơq xók dyaang achak hư bil ađô ơi pei xơp rau yươq mơ chêt, lơq dyaang achak phaai chêt ađô ơi pei xơp rau yươq mơ chêt, nek bhêêl achêk, paraaq ơi xaraq e yuur vaaih kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">“Akan chêt ơi bâân lâân galuôn kalóóng rau lơh đươk.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Akan chêt ơơi, rau đươk ưng amei n'dhiq tơơt?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">Akan chêt ơơi, havi chapââr ưng amei n'dhiq tơơt?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Hơq havi chapââr ưng akan chêt nek matu lơt, hayơq kataai karơ ưng matu lơt nek gani. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Bơơi tapôông leq Yaang Pleng paraaq ma-ơơn, Yaang đóng leq nôôq he rau đươk lơh dhiq Chuôq nôôq he, Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih! <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Taai kơi achêk, adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr ưng aku ơơi, phaai val kơi tamưng panhơm, kah tââi tadhơ, xók taluôn luôn xưa bhlaai kalóóng tarnêêng Chuôq, taai n'nal kơi rau kadhaap nhok ưng adhi anó eh rau nek kah malơơi kalóóng Chuôq.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Leq tarnêêng nhan pagoop đóng nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq, ting kơi aku ơi pató pachóóm đóng nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq parah Ga-la-ti, adhi anó kung phaai têêng kơi achêk. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Dyóp tangêi tarnââp ưng tapól tangêi, ting chanak kalóóng adhi anó phaai lơơi pantua, xók goop karong đô-đaak n'đó ađek la manưih achêk bâân yưưm pale chanoh, buôn xók aku bhral, e yươq kơng phaai pagoop karong rau dyơq bhêêl ađek. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Mat lââng, xók aku bhral, la adhi anó iêm lóóm nôôq manưih ngaai, nek aku e kayua piđó đââng kaliim ưng adhi anó nek palơq bha-aar thơ tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Hayơq la tarnêêng achêk kung nek rau đaang buôn aku phaai vôôiq, nek piđó e yuur vôôiq palơq aku. <verse eid="1CO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Bơơi aku e tơk palơq adhi anó xong xók chênh aku ơi vôôiq hót Ma-xê-đoan, ơi aku xók vôôiq kóh hót Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Hayơq ve n'jau aku e tơơt lóóiq palơq adhi anó, môôiq patơk mơ bhơt nil hapruôt, buôn adhi anó ve chóóm đââng aku yuur vôôiq la aku kơng vôôiq ve leq ađek. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Ơi aku kah kiêng lum adhi anó bhêêl ađôk dhiq kalơng vôôiq lalơh, ơi aku rââm bhiêk tơơt palơq adhi anó mưi ganah, la Chuôq đóng pheep. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Bơơi aku e tơơt lóóiq dhiq Ê-phê-sô đóng patơk Bhiêk xââng jêt tangêi, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Taai mưi bóng palóng bhươh lơq ve mayưưm ơi yuur lóng đóng aku, hơq bơk beq lââng nek xók chađơl kajơq aku.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Mat lââng, la Ti-mô-thê bhral, phaai chamet lêi buôn ađó achêk tơơt palơq adhi anó ting kơi yươq rau paprô kachiit, taai ađó achêk xók têêng tarnêêng Chuôq, dhiêp kơi aku. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Taai ađek, óóq ngaai hayơq lêi kađiq ađó achêk. Bơơi phaai poor ađó achêk vôôiq kalơng yươq rauha, buôn ađó achêk ve chóóm tơk palơq aku, ơi aku dyơq đương rââm ađó achêk nek palơq nôôq adhi anó lââng. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Hayơq leq manưih adhi anó A-bô-lô, aku ơi bhơt praan bhơơl lóóm ađó achêk buôn đóng ađó achêk tơk palơq adhi anó palơq nôôq adhi anó lââng, hơq ađek eh alua ve rau kanóq kiêng ưng ađó achêk ng'kơi đóng ađó achêk tơk xók bhêêl ađôk. Dhơ kơi ađek ađó achêk e tơk xók ve bâân bhêêl.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Phaai hêch lêi; phaai dyương tamưng kalóng lóóm huuiq; phaai grâ lóóm đaang nek manưih padruuih; phaai grâ karơ. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Phaai lơơi dyóp tarnêêng ưng adhi anó bâân yuur vaaih kalóóng lóóm tanhơr.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Mat lââng, nhan móón adhi anó, aku bhơơl lóóm adhi anó (adhi anó n'nal manưih đong ưng Sê-pha-na, kơi piđó nek pale bóóng nil tanââp dhiq A-chaai, lơq piđó ơi tư đââng achak leq tarnêêng têêng yaauq nôôq kabhuh huuiq), <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />buôn đóng adhi anó kung xâng bóóp nôôq manưih kơi achêk palơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai marau tarnêêng têêng lơq nhưh nhok. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Aku bhuui marhaal leq tarnêêng Sê-pha-na, Phôôt-tu-na lơq A-chaai-kơ bhral, taai piđó ơi poor tabing hau rau dyơq tabhuch tââq dhiq adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Taai piđó ơi têêng tame lóóiq lóóm karnóq ưng aku lơq ưng adhi anó. Kơi achêk, phaai đơơp đươi nôôq manưih kơi achêk.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Nôôq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq xưưq A-si pagơơi paraaq tamóh tham tơk adhi anó. A-kui-la lơq Bê-rit-siin, nek palơq kabhuh akóón dhơn Chuôq nhoom dhiq đong ưng piđó, bhuui lóóm tamóh tham adhi anó kalóóng chuôq. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Tabhơt nôôq adhi anó tamóh tham adhi anó. Phaai tamóh tham xóng ađêi palơq chanum yeh Chuôq.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Paraaq tamóh tham ađô nek tââq chênh têi aku — Phaau-lô. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />La ngaai manưih kah bhi nh'nhơr Chuôq, nek manưih ađek phaai đơơp rau tóh đua! Kakoh Chuôq nôôq akóón, nhan Amei bhral! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Rââm nhan ơơn phươk liêm ưng Chuôq Jê-su tơơt palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Lóóm tanhơr ưng aku tơơt palơq tabhơt adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. A-meen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>